 "intro_zh": "鼓浪屿风景区与厦门市区隔海相对，面积1.78平方公里，海岛景观秀丽多姿，享誉中外。岛上海岸线蜿蜒曲折，坡缓沙细的天然海滨浴场环布四周，鬼斧神工的礁石奇趣天成，鼓浪屿有日光岩、菽庄花园、皓月园、毓园等景点。",
 "intro_en": "Gulangyu Scenic Area faces Xiamen City across the sea, covering an area of ​​1.78 square kilometers. The island has a beautiful and diverse landscape and is well-known at home and abroad. The coastline of the island is winding and winding, surrounded by natural bathing beaches with gentle slopes and fine sand. The miraculous reefs are naturally formed. Gulangyu Island has Sunlight Rock, Shuzhuang Garden, Haoyue Garden, Yuyuan and other scenic spots.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
